# Ghost-text suggestion in the empty editor after one answer.
Output "/tmp/supi-screenshots/supi-prompt-suggestions.gif"
Set Width 1400
Set Height 400
Source "screenshots/tapes/_setup.tape"
Type "List the three largest packages under packages/ by file count. Answer briefly."
Enter
Sleep 25s
Screenshot "screenshots/supi-prompt-suggestions.png"
Source "screenshots/tapes/_teardown.tape"
